  {
   "id": "ashina-the-red-witch-132762@patch-2022-10-28",
   "gameId": "ashina-the-red-witch-132762",
   "displayName": "Quick Patch!",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-10-28T07:27:19.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I've received some reports about bugs with the game menus which I have resolved but at a sacrifice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changelog",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "* Options menu has been removed from the title menu as it was causing major issues with the in-game menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Added the Chapter select option in the space of the options menu as I see it makes more sense to be with the rest of the options and not to the right.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* Fixed the auto text option in the game settings menu. Now you can turn off the typewriter style test to just show each line instantly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*Fixed a few minor misc bugs too.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for reporting and for playing the game! If you've enjoyed it, please consider leaving a review to help spread awareness of the game so I can make my future games better for all you to enjoy, thank you :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
